{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03741","headline":"王屋山第之侧杂构小亭暇日与羣公同游 · 李峤","name":"王屋山第之侧杂构小亭暇日与羣公同游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂亭依绝巘，兰榭俯回溪。\n绮栋鱼鳞出，雕甍凤羽栖。\n引泉聊涨沼，凿磴且通蹊。\n席上山花落，帘前野树低。\n弋林开曙景，钓渚发晴霓。\n狎水惊梁雁，临风听楚鸡。\n复看题柳叶，弥喜荫桐圭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}